### Test Firebase - Envoyer à un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/firebase
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "tokens": ["test_fcm_token_here"],
  "title": "🔔 Test Firebase",
  "body": "Ceci est un test de notification Firebase",
  "data": {
    "type": "TEST",
    "timestamp": "2024-04-28T12:00:00Z"
  },
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}

### Test Firebase - Envoyer à plusieurs utilisateurs
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/firebase
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "tokens": ["token1", "token2", "token3"],
  "title": "📢 Message important",
  "body": "Maintenance prévue demain",
  "data": {
    "type": "MAINTENANCE",
    "date": "2024-04-29"
  }
}

### Test OneSignal - Envoyer à tous les utilisateurs
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/onesignal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "sendToAll": true,
  "title": "📢 Annonce importante",
  "message": "Nouvelle fonctionnalité disponible !",
  "data": {
    "type": "ANNOUNCEMENT",
    "feature": "notifications"
  },
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/announcement.jpg",
  "url": "https://your-app.com/announcements",
  "buttons": [
    {
      "id": "view_details",
      "text": "Voir les détails",
      "url": "https://your-app.com/details"
    },
    {
      "id": "dismiss",
      "text": "Ignorer"
    }
  ]
}

### Test OneSignal - Envoyer à un segment spécifique
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/onesignal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "segments": ["agents_douala"],
  "title": "🧹 Nouveau signalement",
  "message": "Un débordement a été signalé à Bonapriso",
  "data": {
    "type": "BIN_REPORT",
    "binId": "bin_123",
    "reportType": "DEBORDEMENT"
  },
  "url": "https://your-app.com/reports/bin_123"
}

### Test OneSignal - Envoyer à des utilisateurs spécifiques
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/onesignal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "playerIds": ["player_id_1", "player_id_2"],
  "title": "🔧 Intervention assignée",
  "message": "Une nouvelle intervention vous a été assignée",
  "data": {
    "type": "INTERVENTION",
    "interventionId": "int_456"
  },
  "url": "https://your-app.com/interventions/int_456"
}

### Notification automatique - Signalement de bac
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/bin-report
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "binId": "9ecd61c0-d3c8-49f8-97ec-66c227058ad1",
  "reportType": "DEBORDEMENT",
  "neighborhood": "Bonapriso",
  "urgency": "HIGH"
}

### Notification automatique - Assignation d'intervention
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/intervention-assigned
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "agentId": "agent_user_id",
  "interventionId": "int_789",
  "binRefCode": "BAC-001",
  "reportType": "Dégradation"
}

### Notification automatique - Changement de statut de bac
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/send/bin-status-change
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "binId": "9ecd61c0-d3c8-49f8-97ec-66c227058ad1",
  "refCode": "BAC-001",
  "oldStatus": "ACTIF",
  "newStatus": "INACTIF",
  "neighborhood": "Bonapriso"
}

### Test des notifications (endpoint de test)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
